# RADR logo — FROZEN

The logo is **APPROVED IMMUTABLE BRAND ARTWORK**.

## Source of truth (verbatim only)

- `/public/brand/radr-wordmark-master-v4.svg`
- `/public/brand/radr-mark-master-v4.svg`
- theme variants: `*-master-v4-white.svg`, `*-master-v4-mono-*.svg`

Prior `*-master-v2*` / `*-master-v3*` files are archived. Do not rewire live surfaces to them.
Traced `*-master.svg` (pre-clean) and `*-traced*.svg` files are superseded. Do not reintroduce them.

## Forbidden

- Editing SVG path / circle / viewBox / fills
- Substituting approx / legacy / CSS / typed “RADR” + separate dot
- Rebalancing, sharpening, cropping, or transforming the artwork to “fit”
- Page-specific logo implementations
- Reverting to sharp polygon A (v2/v3)

## Required

- Render only via `FrozenRadrLogo` (or `RadrLogo` shim → FrozenRadrLogo)
- Square / card / intelligence nodes: use `RadrMarkNode` (safe-area ~46% + center) — never raw mark sizing per page
- If clipped / wrong: **fix the container** (`object-fit: contain`, safe-area inset, never edit SVG)
- One dimension + `height: auto` — never distort aspect ratio

## Do not touch during other passes

Homepage, color, motion, 4K QA, performance work must **not** modify:

- `components/brand/FrozenRadrLogo.tsx`
- `public/brand/radr-*-master-v4*.svg`
- `public/brand/favicon.svg` path geometry
